{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Sanctify to Me every firstborn.</b> That they all become obligated in redemption like all other consecrated things, so that they be permitted for ordinary labor — for without redemption they were forbidden to do any mundane work, as in וְלֹא תַעֲבֹד בְּבְכֹר שׁוֹרֶךָ (Deuteronomy 15:19). And the redemption of their soul is the fixed valuation for a one-month-old, as stated in the parashah of valuations, that being the time of his redemption, as it says: וּפְדוּיוֹ מִבֶּן חֹדֶשׁ תִּפְדֶּה (Numbers 18:16)."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:25:18.561381651Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}